WEBVTT

00:19:29.704 --> 00:19:35.204
And that's sort of their thing and that
they're perhaps a bit reluctant to be

00:19:35.204 --> 00:19:37.038
as flexible or rethink things.

00:19:37.038 --> 00:19:39.746
Then, you know, I've worked people like,
for example, with Matt Reeves,

00:19:40.371 --> 00:19:44.163
with whom I did Felicity, and we did
the Cloverfield movie together.

00:19:44.163 --> 00:19:48.246
And he's someone who you know, and I've
known him since we were kids.

00:19:48.246 --> 00:19:52.038
And he's always rethinking.

00:19:52.038 --> 00:19:55.079
And I find that I'm maybe more, you know,

00:19:55.079 --> 00:19:58.288
someone who would want to try something
and put it out there

00:19:58.288 --> 00:20:03.038
and sort of commit to it for now and sort
of see where it goes. And Matt.